## Next Steps

After deployment to Vercel:
1. Speed Insights will automatically start collecting performance metrics
2. View metrics in the Vercel dashboard under your project's Speed Insights tab
3. Monitor Web Vitals scores and identify performance bottlenecks
4. No additional configuration required for basic usage
